<figure class="lms-figure" aria-labelledby="fig-players">
  <figcaption id="fig-players" class="lms-figure-caption">Who is who in one card sale</figcaption>
  <div class="lms-players">
    <div class="lms-players-zone">
      <p class="lms-players-zone-title">At our counter</p>
      <ul class="lms-players-list">
        <li class="lms-player lms-player-us"><span class="lms-player-name">Rupert (register)</span><span class="lms-player-role">Builds the sale and asks the terminal to charge it. Never sees the card.</span></li>
        <li class="lms-player lms-player-us"><span class="lms-player-name">Dejavoo P18</span><span class="lms-player-role">Terminal. Reads the chip, encrypts it, takes the tip, prints the slip.</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="lms-players-zone">
      <p class="lms-players-zone-title">Our providers</p>
      <ul class="lms-players-list">
        <li class="lms-player"><span class="lms-player-name">Dejavoo cloud / Authorize.net</span><span class="lms-player-role">Gateways. The secure pipe that carries the request and brings back the answer.</span></li>
        <li class="lms-player"><span class="lms-player-name">Valmar</span><span class="lms-player-role">Merchant services. Our account, pricing, statements, disputes, support.</span></li>
        <li class="lms-player"><span class="lms-player-name">Processor + acquiring bank</span><span class="lms-player-role">Behind Valmar. Route the transaction and fund our deposits.</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="lms-players-zone">
      <p class="lms-players-zone-title">The card world</p>
      <ul class="lms-players-list">
        <li class="lms-player lms-player-far"><span class="lms-player-name">Visa · Mastercard · Amex · Discover</span><span class="lms-player-role">Card networks. Set the rules, carry the messages, charge assessments.</span></li>
        <li class="lms-player lms-player-far"><span class="lms-player-name">Customer's bank (issuer)</span><span class="lms-player-role">Issued the card. Approves or declines, pays us, bills the customer.</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</figure>
